From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:56:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] SessionManager: reconnect a dropped ssh tab and show
 plain session names

An ssh tab opens again by itself when the connection drops, waiting a little
longer each time and giving up after five quick failures. A session that
only has a number is shown as tmux 3 instead of 3.
